<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Oscar Temaru</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">born 1944</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Oscar Temaru is a French Polynesian politician, founder of the pro-independence party Tavini Huiraatira and long-time mayor of Faaa. He served several times as president of French <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polynesia">Polynesia</a> between 2004 and 2013, alternating in power with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gaston-flosse">Gaston Flosse</a>, and campaigned for the territory's return to the UN list of non-self-governing territories, achieved in 2013.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/oscar-temaru.jpg" alt="Oscar Temaru" width="320" height="443" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Saga70 · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oscar_Temaru_2015.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
